%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/post/mv3-g02c/contract.json
%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/components/message-item/message-item.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/components/chat-input/chat-input.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/components/chat-standalone/chat-container-standalone/chat-container-standalone.component.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点失败消息上的重发按钮，消息重新走一遍发送流程（含附件重新上传），成功后转为已发送
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=partial；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: sendMessage(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_retry_send + im_send_message", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_retry_send + im_send_message", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_retry_send + im_send_message", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 重发（含附件重新上传） 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Scan or Persist（message + channel + viewer member + cursor）
  Host->>DB: account-scoped read or write
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(local result)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(local)
  E->>IM: correlate local result
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message + channel + viewer member + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:post:received，im:channel:update-by-post）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：发送成功后发送者侧 channel.unreadCount 绝对归零（== 0，不是递减）；频道内其它可见成员的 getMemberUnread(channelId, otherUserId).unreadCount 相比发送前恰好 +1（幂等累加）；该值必须各侧独立计算，禁止用发送者数值推导；message.readBits 长度 == channel.members.length，位序 == channel.members 顺序，发送者对应位 == '1'；接收者对应位在其调用 postRead 之前恒为 '0'，不得因发送者已读而被置 '1'
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：重试入口提交 im_retry_send，沿用原 temporaryId；不得递归派发重试或新增重复消息；失败态不得用失败发生时刻改写 createAt，必须沿用 localCreateAt（否则破坏排序与底部锚点补偿）
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:post:received，im:channel:update-by-post；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
